# 9. Security

### Definition

Security protects systems and data from unauthorized access and attacks.

### Why do we use it?

We need to protect:

• User information
• Passwords
• Financial information
• APIs
• Databases
• Infrastructure

### Real life example

Banking applications use:

• Passwords
• OTP
• Encryption
• Authentication
• Authorization

