# 16. Search

### Definition

Search allows users to quickly find relevant information from a large dataset.

### Why do we use it?

Searching millions of records directly in a database can be slow.

A dedicated search system can provide faster and more flexible searching.

### Real life example

Amazon search:

```text
"wireless headphones"
```

The system needs to find relevant products from millions of products.

### Common technologies

Elasticsearch

OpenSearch

Solr

### Example

```text
User
 ↓
Search API
 ↓
